          <div class="rd-clamp rd-worum-text rd-text">
            <div class="rd-eyebrow">Supervision</div>
            <h2 class="rd-h2">What it is about</h2>
            <p>Supervision is a break from direct professional activity, a joint &ldquo;looking at it from above&rdquo;. The &ldquo;House of Supervision&rdquo; with its &ldquo;glass floor&rdquo; shows what is meant: with some distance, we look at everyday work. In a confidential setting, the dynamics of professional situations become easier to understand, and new perspectives and alternative courses of action emerge.</p>
            <p>This also involves your own role, collaboration with others and relief. Successful supervision processes help to build professional skills, to handle tasks more effectively and to increase job satisfaction.</p><button class="rd-readmore" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="faq-toggle"></span><span class="rd-readmore-t">Read more</span></button>
          </div>
        </div>
